<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Jammu and Kashmir are intensifying a hunt for 65 foreign terrorists while the Union Home Secretary and the IB Director are scheduled to visit for a high-level security review. In Manipur, security forces killed a suspected KCP cadre, apprehended eight others in an encounter, and separately arrested six militants while the Assam Rifles expanded community outreach. The state reported that deaths from spurious liquor have risen to 20, with nine arrested persons remanded to police custody. In Chhattisgarh’s Bastar region, caches containing arms, night-vision equipment, a drone and cash were seized, and three Maoist dumps were recovered in Bijapur. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5UaURtQjUyU0FXUW5hcFlGMUFmVUVZNEtLRzJhbU43LTR2cl9KbEpQUUtQdUxRcG5EUnpFQ3lNRzJMZjRaOTJvaDlxR3NNc09uWldmckhtbm9lMmZWcERTenpDLU1zbU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekashmirimages.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNck1oRTBuTlJnbkdwa0lONU9BVVlNUG9aTXczeF83NUUtRFYzamtwQXRLRmxaRU43VnJUdVFrLVc5dlYxcEdiempHUG5tNjB2UXJQYmJOOU0xbTZRSU1IbVVtaHB1QTdBTGNyUEIwaXh3cHl3SGplSXVkVjc1MHA4RGs0UGJxUENVN1ktUTlaQXNjcVA3enlObFNOejUwa3dxMVFRRjIxSFFLd1Vm?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekashmirimages.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPc3FaYy1HMFhmTWFHTVNrRnV3aHhVUHRuNlhFaEo2T24tMW5fc2lzM1hYMzV5Y2lhQ3ZRWmZBejlfSHBoNkZHQkpjeTdmTUI4cTdETjdVb01wUDFtVVR0UDRHdEdQRFVGQ1NEcll3TW5zTEg1dVM3dXYtdWpvMzItWEd2U1N5bUZ0OXcxYVB5MVZYanhs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Only Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi__?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/a